// Title: Java Running with Remote Debugging
// Rule ID: 8f88e3f6-2a49-48f5-a5c4-2f7eedf78710
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.t1203, attack.execution
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_java_remote_debugging.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
